    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35770" root="قصر" body-key="q">
    
      8 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اقتصر عَلَى الأَمْرِ</span></b>  <i>He confined, restricted,</i> or
<i>limited, himself to the thing,</i> or <i>affair; did not
exceed it.</i> (M, K. *) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اقتصر عَلَى الشَّىْءِ</span>, (S,) or
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">على كَذَا</span>, (Msb,) [and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِكَذَا</span>,] <i>He was satisfied,</i>
or <i>content,</i> (S, Msb,) <i>with the thing,</i> (S,) or <i>with
such a thing.</i> (Msb.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اقتصر عَلَى أَمْرِى</span> <i>He
obeyed my command.</i> (JK.)

